window.EN={"1":"...Raydrik, too, proved unexpectedly useless. Now, how shall I deal with them...","2":"...Veld...","3":"L-Lord Manfroy! When did you come here...","4":"Never mind such things. What is taking you so long over one mere whelp of Leonster?","5":"Sir, I have no excuse. Before long, I will have Prince Leif's head without fail...","6":"Understand: you are to slay that whelp without fail.","7":"Otherwise there would have been no point in going so far as to incite Thracia to strike down Prince Quan.","8":"...Those people still seem to think Travant is the one who killed Prince Quan...","9":"Heh heh heh, pitiful creatures. As if the likes of Thracia had the intelligence to pinpoint when Leonster would march.","10":"Using Travant's ambition to make north and south Thracia devour each other... your scheme hit the mark, in short.","11":"I am humbled by your praise...","12":"But what came after is the problem. Did you not underestimate the whelp of Leonster a little too much?","13":"Perhaps, after all, he should have been assassinated when Leonster fell...","14":"However, it is surely a fact that Prince Leif has united the rebellious elements of northern Thracia into one.","15":"If we strike them all together, the rebels' morale will fall to the ground. The greater the hope, the greater the backlash...","16":"And still more conveniently, he seems to be defeating for us even Friege, which has been in our way in various respects...","17":"Why, he may carry the blood of the crusaders, but in the end he cannot even wield the earth lance Gae Bolg handed down in Leonster.","18":"He is no match for this Veld.","19":"I hope so... To be safe, I will lend you five deadlords.","20":"I am grateful. Together with the one I made myself, six... With this the barrier is complete...","21":"Hmm...","22":"Then, Veld, I am counting on you. I await good news...","23":"Sir...","24":"August, will everyone be all right?","25":"The arrangements are in place. All that remains is for each to fulfill their responsibility...","26":"Unless the six barriers are broken, the altar will not open. That's it, isn't it?","27":"Yes...","28":"For that, the center of each tower must be seized in six places at the same time.","29":"If we dawdle, there is a risk reinforcements will appear.","30":"Here, even if it means accepting some sacrifices, we seize them in one stroke.","31":"I see... Understood. Then, let's go.","32":"Wh-what! The seal has been broken, you say!!","33":"Grr... Leif... what impudence...","34":"Then I'll take you people along on the road to the next world too!","35":"With this Stone, become stone and sleep!","36":"...Did we... win...?","37":"Yes...","38":"The power of Loptr in northern Thracia has now been extinguished.","39":"The people of Thracia have at last been freed from Loptr's yoke.","40":"This, too, is all through your strength, Prince. Truly... you have done well.","41":"No... August... it's thanks to you. You guided me.","42":"I knew nothing, and you taught me what a sovereign should be.","43":"August, thank you. I was fortunate to have met you. I thank you from my heart...","44":"This... puts me at a loss...","45":"I can say it now: I became your strategist, Prince, by the order of a certain person.","46":"At first, to be honest, I thought the liberation of northern Thracia was impossible.","47":"But seeing how utterly single-minded you were, Prince,","48":"before I knew it, I came to think that you were the very one.","49":"For that reason I said various discourteous things as well. Please forgive me.","50":"No. Your words always weighed heavily on my heart, August.","51":"I learned from you the depth of people's suffering and sorrow.","52":"August, I want you to go on helping me. I need you.","53":"Sir... If you wish it, Prince...","54":"Lord Leif.","55":"According to word from Seliph's army, Connacht has been seized by the Liberation Army!","56":"What, Connacht has fallen! Then Lord Seliph...?","57":"I am told he is heading this way to help in taking Munster.","58":"He must not yet know of our victory.","59":"I see... To take that strong Connacht Castle in just one day... that's Lord Seliph for you.","60":"But if I could have, I'd have liked to strike down King Bloom with my own hands.","61":"Yes... But Lord Leif, with this, northern Thracia has at last been liberated.","62":"The people rejoice at the Liberation Army's victory. Here in Munster, too, the people are shouting your name in a frenzy.","63":"That Thracia was liberated by the child of the hero Quan...","64":"Finn, they certainly were long and painful days.","65":"But because you were there, Finn, I was able to bear it.","66":"Because it must have been far more painful for you than for me.","67":"You sacrificed yourself and raised me this far.","68":"I as good as grew up on your knee.","69":"What can I do to repay you?","70":"Lord Leif, the four kingdoms of northern Thracia,","71":"Leonster, Ulster, Connacht, and Munster,","72":"have, apart from your Kingdom of Leonster, no male heir to the throne.","73":"Therefore their peoples wish to be unified under you, Lord Leif.","74":"Lord Leif, please grant their wish.","75":"Thracia's tragedy comes from the rivalry of small states and from wars repeated over and over.","76":"To unify Thracia and build the ideal kingdom that once prospered under Dain and Nova...","77":"That was the late Lord Quan's dream, and it is my wish as well.","78":"Yes, I know. I'm not running anymore.","79":"I have a duty to protect northern Thracia.","80":"Whether the unification of Thracia comes about depends on what King Travant does, but I want to do everything I can.","81":"Finn, is that all right...","82":"Yes, Lord Leif.","83":"Lord Leif, I'm sorry, but we must go back to Fiana now.","84":"What! Why? Aren't you coming with me, Eyvel!?","85":"I hear pirates are rampaging on the coast again. We cannot abandon the villagers.","86":"Besides, we can no longer be of use in the battles to come.","87":"But... Eyvel...","88":"Lord Leif, I look forward to the day you win the war with the Empire and return to Leonster.","89":"When that time comes, I'll hurry there with everyone from Fiana to celebrate.","90":"...Right... I understand, Eyvel. I'll come back for sure.","91":"Wait for me...","92":"Yes. I'll be waiting, Lord Leif...","93":"Prince Leif, may I have a moment?","94":"Princess Miranda? What is it?","95":"I... have something I must apologize to you for.","96":"If it's about Dorias, it's all right now. That was my responsibility, and it's nothing for you to worry about, Miranda.","97":"Besides, Ulster was liberated by Seliph's army,","98":"and the people must be glad to learn that Princess Miranda is safe too.","99":"Yes, well... But the people want union with Leonster,","100":"and the chief vassals keep nagging me to become the prince's consort. They look down on me because I'm a woman.","101":"Of the four royal houses, only you and I survived, Miranda, so it can't be helped if some think that way.","102":"But I'm not yet...","103":"Do you dislike me, Prince? If so, that's fine with me, but...","104":"It's not that. I still have things I must do.","105":"The war with Thracia, the matter of the dark cult, and the Grannvale Empire still stands, and I must protect northern Thracia too.","106":"Right now I don't have the leeway to think about liking or disliking someone.","107":"......","108":"Fine. Then I'll wait in Ulster for your return, Prince.","109":"But a man who can't even defeat Thracia, I'd turn down myself. Understand, Prince Leif!","110":"Lord Leif...","111":"Linoan, northern Thracia has returned to our hands, but Tahra is still held by Thracia.","112":"But I will take it back for sure. You'll come with me, won't you, Linoan?","113":"Yes, of course! Lord Leif.","114":"Lady Linoan, I'm sorry, but I can't go with you.","115":"What? Why, Dean? Why!","116":"Thracia is my homeland. I can't fight any further.","117":"You should go with the prince, Linoan. From now on the prince will protect you.","118":"Dean... Why do you say such a thing...","119":"I... can't manage without you, Dean.","120":"Linoan...?","121":"If you don't want to, Dean, I'll give up on going back to Tahra.","122":"So please stay with me like this...","123":"Don't talk nonsense, Linoan. It isn't like you!","124":"But... let me think it over a little more. As things stand, both Prince Leif and that man will end up hurt.","125":"That alone must be avoided at all costs...","126":"......","127":"Lady Nanna, come on, just say it already!","128":"B-but...","129":"If you can't say it now, you'll regret it forever. Are you fine with staying the cute little sister for good?","130":"But, Mareeta...","131":"Oh, honestly, you're so exasperating!","132":"Lord Leif!","133":"Mareeta? What is it, with such a scary face?","134":"Go on, Lady Nanna...","135":"Lord Leif...","136":"Nanna, thank you. It's thanks to you that I was able to come this far.","137":"Oh no, I didn't do anything...","138":"No.","139":"You and I grew up like brother and sister, but the one being helped was always me.","140":"Because you supported me, because you always gave me courage, I think I was able to keep going this far.","141":"Nanna, when this war is over, I'll go and look for Lachesis too.","142":"And if I can meet Lachesis, I mean to say it plainly.","143":"Please give me... Nanna... whom I love...","144":"!... Lord Leif...","145":"Our fight is still far from over, but Nanna, you'll come with me, won't you?","146":"Yes, Lord Leif...","147":"Lord Leif, Lord Seliph has arrived.","148":"Prince Leif, I came to back you up, but it seems there was no need.","149":"I'm relieved that you're safe.","150":"Lord Seliph! This, too, is all thanks to you. Thank you so very much.","151":"No, the liberation of northern Thracia is something you accomplished by your own strength, Prince. I did nothing.","152":"Northern Thracia will come together as one country under you, Prince.","153":"If that rich and great country will fight against the Empire,","154":"nothing could be more heartening to us in the Liberation Army.","155":"Prince Leif, will you go on advancing together with us?","156":"There is still much that we must do. Surely many hardships await.","157":"But I think that with you, Prince Leif, the two of us can overcome them.","158":"Just as our fathers once were, I want us too to swear lifelong, unchanging friendship as friends who can share life and death.","159":"Yes!","160":"I think of you as an older brother, Lord Seliph. If I can be of help to you, nothing could make me happier.","161":"Then let us swear on this sword. Though we were born at different times, we shall die together.","162":"As friends, as brothers, let us swear to join hands and save this world!","163":"Yes! Lord Seliph!!...","164":"Heh heh heh... You defy me knowing nothing... Then learn my power!","165":"Guh... I... Absurd...","166":"But... it is not over yet...","167":"Even if I die... Loptr will not perish...","168":"The revival of the Loptr Empire... is close... at hand...","169":"Struggle all you can until then... Heh heh heh... hahahahaha...","170":"Lord Manfroy, forgive me... gah..."};
